{"4056000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cleaning Raccrew", "steam_appid": 4056000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the last Raccoon standing in Cleaning Raccrew! Claim your spot at the very top and get your paws on the coveted golden broom, even if you have to push your friends onto the cold water below to do it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056000/extras/530288cc6f92bdf79db827da65ac32f8.poster.avif?t=1785887110\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056000/extras/530288cc6f92bdf79db827da65ac32f8.webm?t=1785887110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056000/extras/530288cc6f92bdf79db827da65ac32f8.mp4?t=1785887110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Putting the Crew in Raccrew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 3 friends in this 4 player, free-for-all game. Use fun powerups and outwit your friends to send them flying! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056000/extras/7ecc992f4caee98d8cce5d0ae8f16288.poster.avif?t=1785887110\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056000/extras/7ecc992f4caee98d8cce5d0ae8f16288.webm?t=1785887110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056000/extras/7ecc992f4caee98d8cce5d0ae8f16288.mp4?t=1785887110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></spa